@startuml

actor Customer

participant Flutter

participant "Laravel API" as API

database MySQL

participant "AI Service" as AIS

participant "OpenAI / Gemini" as AI

Customer -> Flutter : Ask Question

Flutter -> API : POST /api/ai/chat

API -> MySQL : Get User Data

MySQL --> API

API -> MySQL : Get Event Data

MySQL --> API

API -> AIS : Build Prompt

AIS -> AI : Send Prompt

AI --> AIS : AI Response

AIS --> API : Final Response

API -> MySQL : Save Conversation

API --> Flutter : AI Answer

Flutter --> Customer : Display Answer

@enduml